  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Phase of the Danish-Egyptian Dialogue Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DEDI 2024-2028 objective is &#x2018;increasing and effective dialogue and partnerships between Egypt and Denmark leading to innovation, technology adoption, and solutions related to climate change and green growth, and climate, Peace security&#x2019;. While the objective focuses on the role of DEDI as a platform for dialogue and exchange, the three component outcomes are closely aligned to DAPP&#x2019;s overall vision of a better life for young people in the Arab and Africa regions.</narrative>
  </description>
